OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles and Camilla arrive to
OL,4,Aofficially open Wales' parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla
OL,7,Farrive in Cardiff to officially open
OL,8,Fthe new term of the Senedd, Wales'
OL,9,Fparliament
OL,11,FThe King will take part in the ceremony
OL,12,Ffor the first time since he became
OL,13,Fmonarch
OL,15,FIt is also the first opening of a
OL,16,FSenedd term since Plaid Cymru became
OL,17,FWales' largest party and took over the
OL,18,Frunning of its government
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
